Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: libtiff/tif_ojpeg.c
Line: 2024
Function: OJPEGReadHeaderInfoSecTablesQTable
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: Unsigned underflow in loop bound: for (n = 0; n < m - 1; n++) with m as uint8_t. When m == 0 (and qtable_offset[0] != 0), m - 1 wraps to 255, causing the loop to iterate up to 254 and read sp->qtable_offset[n] far past the end of the array.

Source context:
